PRAYER

In the light of the facts and circumstances stated above, the Petitioner most respectfully prays that this Hon'ble Court may graciously be pleased to:

a) Grant special leave to appeal under Article 136 of the Constitution of India against the impugned final judgment and order dated {impugned_order_date} passed by the Hon'ble High Court of {hc_name} in {hc_case_no};

b) Pending hearing and final disposal of the present petition, stay the operation, execution and effect of the said impugned final judgment and order dated {impugned_order_date};

c) Pending hearing and final disposal of the present petition, grant such interim protection as this Hon'ble Court may deem fit;

d) Award costs of the present petition; and

e) Pass any other order(s) as this Hon'ble Court may deem fit and proper in the interest of justice.

And for this act of kindness, the Petitioner shall ever pray.
